// Larger LIMIT/TopN over a higher-cardinality dimension.
// KNOWN LIMITATION (see README.md "Known Limitations"): TOPN over a grouped
// SUMMARIZECOLUMNS result does not fold in Analysis Services' DirectQuery
// engine - it pulls the full grouped result locally before sorting/limiting,
// which can hit AS's 1,000,000-row external-query cap. Kept as a live
// regression check (Run-DaxStudioTests.ps1 excludes it from the pass/fail
// gate) so a future fold-negotiation change that fixes this is noticed.
EVALUATE
TOPN(
    200,
    SUMMARIZECOLUMNS(
        SV_CUSTOMER_ORDERS[CUSTOMER_NAME],
        SV_CUSTOMER_ORDERS[ORDER_DATE],
        "Total Revenue", SUM(SV_CUSTOMER_ORDERS[TOTAL_REVENUE])
    ),
    SV_CUSTOMER_ORDERS[ORDER_DATE], DESC
)
ORDER BY SV_CUSTOMER_ORDERS[ORDER_DATE] DESC
